## Aplikasi

- **Frontend**: Vue 3 + Vite + Element Plus + Tailwind + vue-i18n (locale `id` default, fallback `en`, plus `zh`).
- **Backend**: FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + Alembic + MariaDB.
- **MRP**: Flask (service terpisah); API UI lewat gateway FastAPI [`backend/app/routers/mrp_gateway.py`](backend/app/routers/mrp_gateway.py) → `http://127.0.0.1:5010`.
- **Struktur**: root `package.json` → skrip di `frontend/`; halaman admin `frontend/src/views/admin/`, layout `AdminLayout.vue`, router `/admin/*`.
- **Master Color Swatch**: tabel `color_swatch_recipes`; API `/masters/color-swatch-recipes/*`; halaman `/admin/color-swatch`; import CSV / `dokumentasi/DATA COLOR SWATCH.csv`. PO: FK `color_swatch_recipe_id`; lookup `resolve_swatch_factory_keys()` (customer → `factory_key` swatch).
- **Master Fluorescent Color**: `fluorescent_color_masters`; halaman `/admin/fluorescent-colors`.
- **PO / Lot**: preview lot `POST /po/generate-lot`; final di `add_po_detail`; preview SO `GET /po/next-number`; jadwal kirim 8 gelombang (`PoDetailDelivery`); saldo order = qty − kiriman aktual.
- **Delivery**: daftar `GET /marketing/delivery-lines`; detail `GET /delivery/{id}/details`. Alur: QC OK → packing done → delivery → sent → invoice.

## Terminal / npm di host

Frontend dev utama jalan **systemd** `tonghong-frontend` (nvm Node 22). Untuk npm di shell: `source tools/nvm-load.sh` lalu perintah di `frontend/`, atau skrip root `npm run build` / `dev`.

Python backend/MRP: `backend/.venv` dan `mrp/.venv` (uv, CPython 3.12).

